{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-09",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "一人承担全部责任  (Taking Full Responsibility Alone)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bianbian": "边边",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Continuing their conversation at the bar, Bianbian tells Bu Xiaogu he already deduced that Manta Ray protected her after Finale Night and asks whether exposing it would bring Chun Yuqiao down. Listen to Xiaogu's firm reply in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么两边？我不明白您在说什么。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你就别跟我装了，从那两个嘉宾的事就已经能看出来了，有人要对付淳于乔。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "外界都觉得魔鬼鱼在星天混得春风得意，其实并不是这样的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "当初把你保下来的，就是魔鬼鱼吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "这事要是捅出来，会不会变成他的大麻烦？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那天是因为我的工作失职，导致李铭基先生服药过量引发心脏病。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我作为嫌疑人，在警局里被扣留了一夜。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这件事只是我在负责任，不关任何人的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不管你在何时何地问起我这件事，我都会这么回答。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "至于我为什么还留在星天工作，确实是一个侥幸。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果您要挖这件事，那请继续挖下去，大不了我永远离开这个行业。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你看你舍生取义这样，我都快感动了，不过我已经想好怎么押宝了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那您打算选哪边啊？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么两边？我不明白您在说什么。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What two camps? I do not understand what you mean.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你就别跟我装了，从那两个嘉宾的事就已经能看出来了，有人要对付淳于乔。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop playing innocent with me; from that commentator stunt alone, clearly someone is targeting Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "外界都觉得魔鬼鱼在星天混得春风得意，其实并不是这样的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Outsiders think Manta Ray is thriving effortlessly at Xingtian, yet that is hardly true.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "当初把你保下来的，就是魔鬼鱼吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The one who shielded you and kept you here was Manta Ray, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "这事要是捅出来，会不会变成他的大麻烦？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If this story breaks open, could it turn into a huge headache for him?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那天是因为我的工作失职，导致李铭基先生服药过量引发心脏病。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That night my own lapse on duty led Mr Li Mingji to take excess medicine and suffer a heart attack.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我作为嫌疑人，在警局里被扣留了一夜。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As a suspect, I was held overnight at the police station.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这件事只是我在负责任，不关任何人的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I alone bear responsibility for this incident; it has nothing to do with anyone else.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不管你在何时何地问起我这件事，我都会这么回答。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No matter when or where you ask me about it, this will always be my answer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "至于我为什么还留在星天工作，确实是一个侥幸。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As for why I am still working at Xingtian, that really was just a stroke of luck.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果您要挖这件事，那请继续挖下去，大不了我永远离开这个行业。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you mean to dig into this, dig away; at worst I will leave Xingtian and quit this industry forever.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你看你舍生取义这样，我都快感动了，不过我已经想好怎么押宝了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Watching you sacrifice yourself like this almost moves me to tears, though I already know where to place my bet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那您打算选哪边啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then which side are you planning to back?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么两边？我不明白您在说什么。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你就别跟我装了，从那两个嘉宾的事就已经能看出来了，有人要对付淳于乔。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "外界都觉得魔鬼鱼在星天混得春风得意，其实并不是这样的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "当初把你保下来的，就是魔鬼鱼吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "这事要是捅出来，会不会变成他的大麻烦？",
      "gap": 0.5
